<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) & Fu et al. (2005) ROP2-ROP6 interdigitated puzzle-shaped pavement cell lobing and Largest Empty Circle (LEC) turgor stress scaling — Model fidelity to source: 54/100" ;
