<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-runions-pavement-cell-lobing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sapala et al. (2018) & Fu et al. (2005) ROP2-ROP6 interdigitated puzzle-shaped pavement cell lobing and Largest Empty Circle (LEC) turgor stress scaling — MorphoEval overall 53.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py` (weighted score: 53.6/100). The Pass 1 script evaluates only an empirical curve fit for Largest Empty Circle (LEC) radius and a static cosine contour without solving coupled ROP2-ROP6 anticlinal boundary reaction-diffusion PDEs, Sapala et al. (2018) spring-remodeling cell wall mechanics, exact Euclidean distance-transform LEC radii, ktn1 / rop2 rop4 mutant and monocot parallel-file comparisons, or CV segmentation of the vendored Arabidopsis leaf epidermis micrograph. Overall 53.0/100 (faithfulness 50.1, reproducibility 59.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 54, Morphological realism / specimen match 45, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 54. Output judged: docs/media/pavement_cell_lobing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2017-runions-pavement-cell-lobing.py at 8871db0, image/png, 74721 B, 1260×540 px, artifact_sha256 8e3b33e9aa4c563a678f37b5c0d41f8f4f666780c18827ebdd4a622608c122a2 (sha256 8e3b33e9aa4c563a678f37b5c0d41f8f4f666780c18827ebdd4a622608c122a2), spec_fingerprint 972460a5749d7d30868f5de9c61bcfd278fa143f89d629090a75b7aa4ebdc287. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 972460a5749d7d30868f5de9c61bcfd278fa143f89d629090a75b7aa4ebdc287; artifact_sha256: 8e3b33e9aa4c563a678f37b5c0d41f8f4f666780c18827ebdd4a622608c122a2; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/arabidopsis_pavement_cell_specimen.jpg=4b7c1062f6ebfd6e..., datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/paper_citations.bib=e5d0ea8ec26365c9..., datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/pavement_cell_lobing_reference.json=de4e6daab5eae4a0..., datasets/pavement_cell_lobing/scout_manifest.json=72c917ec10ac1a55...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 dataset verification, 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with statistical p-values and negative controls, and an 8-point deterministic `--self-test` suite.",
        "remediation needed: Implement automated computer-vision segmentation of the SHA-256-locked Arabidopsis thaliana leaf epidermis micrograph (`arabidopsis_pavement_cell_specimen.jpg`) to extract interlocking pavement cell contours, lobeyness L = P_perim / P_hull, solidity S = A / A_hull, lobe count, and inscribed R_LEC circles.",
        "remediation needed: Implement coupled ROP2-RIC4 and ROP6-RIC1-KTN1 mutual-inhibition cortical reaction-diffusion PDEs across shared anticlinal walls (Fu et al. 2005 Cell; Lin et al. 2013 Curr Biol), verifying intracortical anticorrelation and trans-wall lobe-neck antiphase complementarity.",
        "remediation needed: Implement the Sapala et al. (2018) eLife mechanical spring-remodeling puzzle cell growth solver across cell area A in [250, 4500] um^2 with exact Euclidean distance-transform Largest Empty Circle (R_LEC) computation across wild-type Col-0, rop2 rop4 RNAi, ktn1/ric1 mutants, and parallel-file monocot epidermis." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

